== error
-- after 1
the database is at release 2, before `-- @oldest 3`: the @drop and @from lines it needs were deleted. Open it first with an executable of a release that still had them, or put them back.

== query
SELECT meal.title, dish.name, dish.price_ore FROM course JOIN meal ON meal.id = course.menu_id JOIN dish ON dish.id = course.dish_id ORDER BY course.id

